          "it then carries 5.23 W into 40 \u00b0C air: 11 K/W or lower, heatsink to ambient",
          "With no heatsink at all, a package may have up to 50 K/W from junction to air (RthJA on the datasheet) for its hottest junction to stay 25 \u00b0C under its rating, counting the hardest-worked one, running and held still. A TO-220 standing free has about 62, a TO-247 about 40, a surface-mount part on its copper 40 to 60"
